  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Climate Infrastructure Financing Partnership (PCIFP) - Off-Grid Programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIFFP is progressing a pipeline of clean energy and climate adaptation investments under the Pacific Climate Infrastructure Financing Partnership (PCIFP). Component 3 includes small scale, off-grid renewable energy infrastructure to boost development in remote and rural communities. INO237 is primarily used to record the financing, concept, design and implementation quality assurance of investments under the third PCIFP component, in particular the major initiative &apos;REnew Pacific&apos;, commencing in 2024-25. The goal of REnew Pacific is to take renewable energy solutions to rural and remote parts of the Pacific and demonstrate Australia&#x2019;s role as a climate infrastructure partner to the region.</narrative>
  </description>
